    <string name="settings_about_dialog_body">Scanova — Scan Smarter, Instantly.\n\nMendukung format 2D (QR Code, Data Matrix, PDF417, Aztec) dan 1D (EAN-13, EAN-8, UPC-A, UPC-E, Code 128, Code 39, Code 93, Codabar, ITF).\n\nLisensi Sumber Terbuka:\n• Android Jetpack (Compose, CameraX, Room, DataStore, Navigation) — Apache License 2.0\n• Google ML Kit Barcode Scanning — Apache License 2.0 / Google APIs Terms\n• ZXing Core — Apache License 2.0\n• Kotlin Coroutines — Apache License 2.0</string>
